5. Designing stimuli-responsive polymer-inopolymers: Incorporating polymers into inorganic materials, such as ceramics or ceramics, can create smart materials with unique properties. For example, incorporating a temperature-responsive polymer into a ceramic matrix can create a material that can be used for temperature-controlled drug release.

