\[
\begin{cases}
x = 4 + 8t, \\
y = 2 + 4t, \\
z = -2 - 36t.
\end{cases}
\]

Thus, the equation of the line normal to the surface is:

\[
\boxed{
\begin{cases}
x = 4 + 8t, \\
y = 2 + 4t, \\
z = -2 - 36t.
\end{cases}
}
\]
