   The work done per kg of air (\(w\)) in the Otto cycle is:  
   \[
   w = \eta \cdot q_u
   \]  
   where \(q_u\) is the heat input. The heat rejected (\(q_r\)) is given as 544 kJ/kg. For the Otto cycle, the heat input is:  
   \[
   q_u = q_r + w
