- Eigenvalue \(\lambda_3 = 3\), Eigenvector \(v_3 = \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 1 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}\)

The orthogonal matrix \([R]\) is:
\[
